{"title":"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems\">2010 AMC 12A #19</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems\">2010 AMC 10A #23</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2(cheap)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2(cheap)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3(very_cheap)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3(very cheap)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054090e60a5dcb8bc33213620b3af9278f9a3e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> boxes in a line contains a single red marble, and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/4/aa4914539356f9cd067409621814f4b7cbfbf4e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le k \\le 2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"17\" />, the box in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/0/5300af7195084507169b12ba4d5fec382d6513b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\text{th}$\" width=\"25\" height=\"12\" /> position also contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> white marbles. Isabella begins at the first box and successively draws a single marble at random from each box, in order. She stops when she first draws a red marble. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfd17dc4d3100462df726e8eb7f9262783429eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> be the probability that Isabella stops after drawing exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> marbles. What is the smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/8/278248c84b5bd1178f0dcffb2ea38e257eb41a29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(n) &lt; \\frac{1}{2010}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/e/fbe2921093d7ef880d0085c29f148f3b434cde92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 45 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 63 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 64 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 201 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"421\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The probability of drawing a white marble from box <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/3453f4764e6f55c65545d8ca1a2b8b9b64685870.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{k}{k + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"43\" height=\"39\" />, and the probability of drawing a red marble from box <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/e/bfe0cb68f9e0fcd3a240fa4f37606d494a6ab6f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>To stop after drawing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> marbles, we must draw a white marble from boxes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1ef155f179039d7bcc11608d867ff11e0ca9f900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, \\ldots, n-1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" /> and draw a red marble from box <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd923e41635af40a1abe58f230732f2280b0723a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/f/4afea34f3ad6f2274778795778b2d5dad8ab0e85.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(n) = \\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} \\cdots \\frac {n - 1}{n}\\right) \\cdot \\frac{1}{n +1} = \\frac{1}{n (n + 1)}.\\]\" width=\"386\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>So, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f197e63c23f8b9e32481dff05a8fce2370baa4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{n(n + 1)} &lt; \\frac{1}{2010}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"134\" height=\"41\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d33cbc6a9385dacea6bb59599c0246e056e50f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+1) &gt; 2010.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"131\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd81057d052a6e2d394c00239a5b63ad17a29a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> increases as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> increases, we can simply test values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />; after some trial and error, we get that the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e619ae4e4fd8b30391e0718a08a7632589674c88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }45}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/c/0cc5e4a750fed3db3864775efe7ee946643b0182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45(46) = 2070$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/a/4ca0868cb18c502fbb722dc918314869b41feda3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44(45) = 1980.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2.28cheap.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2(cheap)\">Solution 2(cheap)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2(cheap)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Do the same thing as Solution 1, but when we get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/2/e82d586c3353c911543b423d053ebdcab69b5d16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+1)&gt;2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" /> just test all the answer choices in ascending order(from A to E), and stop when one of the answer choices is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054090e60a5dcb8bc33213620b3af9278f9a3e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />. We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2b95ce2eeeabb3ce6bfa3f436017e4e765d2430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45(46)=2070$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" />, which is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/4/054090e60a5dcb8bc33213620b3af9278f9a3e12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, so we are done. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>-vsamc\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3.28very_cheap.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3(very_cheap)\">Solution 3(very cheap)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3(very cheap)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Do the same thing as Solution 1, but when we get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/2/e82d586c3353c911543b423d053ebdcab69b5d16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+1)&gt;2010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />, remember that in our current era, the square root of the year is in the 40s. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd81057d052a6e2d394c00239a5b63ad17a29a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> is close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" />, so only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46f6af01fcf3bb5f6cac2316bc4de9bb3906bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> can be correct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=47XsxmQ5Ej4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=47XsxmQ5Ej4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A\">2010 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2010 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2